[53.436067,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Trace the adjacency, database and route\r\n  =======================================\r\n\r\n  FRR show ip ospf neighbor maps to Ze show ospf neighbor.\r\n  FRR show ip ospf database router maps to show ospf database router.\r\n  FRR show ip ospf route maps to show ospf route.\r\n\r\n  Find FRR router ID 172.29.0.2 in Full and in the Router-LSA database,\r\n  then its loopback route through 172.29.0.2 on frr0.\r\n"]
