[75.036853,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Make a timer disagreement visible\r\n  =================================\r\n\r\n  We now commit a mismatched Hello interval. The neighbor must no longer\r\n  be Full and the route through it must disappear.\r\n\r\n  show ospf interface detail exposes the current timers. The metric\r\n  ze_ospf_packets_dropped_total with reason hello-interval identifies\r\n  why incoming packets are rejected; it must increase for this failure.\r\n"]
